+### Route status
+
+`R2 DEAD (2026-07-23)`: the frontier inequality is false at `r=5`.
+Let `F=M(C_5)` be the 11-vertex Grötzsch graph, with 20 edges,
+`alpha(F)=5`, and clique number two. Its complement `H` has 35 edges,
